\frac{1}{4}{\left\lVert{v}+ {w}\right\rVert}^2 - \frac{1}{4}{\left\lVert{v}- {w}\right\rVert}^2 + \frac{{\mathrm{i}}}{4}{\left\lVert{v}- {\mathrm{i}}{w}\right\rVert}^2 - \frac{{\mathrm{i}}}{4}{\left\lVert{v}+ {\mathrm{i}}{w}\right\rVert}^2,&\text{$V$ complex}
