Voorbeeld 9.9.

({\hat{\tau}}_{\boldsymbol{a}} \delta)[\varphi] = ({\hat{\tau}}_{-\boldsymbol{a}} \varphi)(\boldsymbol{0}) = \varphi(\boldsymbol{0}+\boldsymbol{a}) = \delta_{\boldsymbol{a}}[\varphi] \Rightarrow \int_{{\mathbb{R}}^d}\delta(\boldsymbol{x}-\boldsymbol{a})\varphi(\boldsymbol{x})\,{\mathrm{d}}\boldsymbol{x} =\int_{{\mathbb{R}}^d}\delta_{\boldsymbol{a}} (\boldsymbol{x})\varphi(\boldsymbol{x})\,{\mathrm{d}}\boldsymbol{x}
