Legendre-veeltermen

I = [-1,+1], w(x) = 1: \begin{aligned} &P_0(x) = 1, \quad P_1(x) = x, \quad P_2(x) = \tfrac{1}{2}(3x^2 - 1),\\ &P_3(x) = \tfrac{1}{2}(5x^3 - 3x), \quad P_4(x) = \tfrac{1}{8}(35x^4 - 30x^2 + 3), \quad \ldots\end{aligned} genormaliseerd zodat P_n(1) = 1
Genererende functie (Legendre 1782): \frac{1}{\sqrt{1 - 2xt + t^2}} = \sum_{n=0}^{+\infty} P_n(x)\, t^n \rightarrow via \int_{-1}^{+1} \frac{1}{\sqrt{1 - 2xt + t^2}\sqrt{1 - 2xs + s^2}}\,{\mathrm{d}}x = \frac{1}{\sqrt{ts}}\log\frac{1 + \sqrt{ts}}{1 - \sqrt{ts}}: {\left\langle P_n,P_m\right\rangle} = \int_{-1}^{+1} P_n(x) P_m(x)\,{\mathrm{d}}x = \frac{2}{2n+1}\delta_{n,m}

Hermite-veeltermen

I = {\mathbb{R}}, w(x) = \exp(-x^2): \begin{aligned} &H_0(x) = 1, \quad H_1(x) = 2x, \quad H_2(x) = 4x^2 - 2,\\ &H_3(x) = 8x^3 - 12x, \quad H_4(x) = 16x^4 - 48x^2 + 12, \quad \ldots\end{aligned}
Genererende functie: \exp(2xt - t^2) = \sum_{n=0}^{+\infty} \frac{1}{n!} H_n(x)\, t^n \rightarrow {\left\langle H_m,H_n\right\rangle}_w = \int_{-\infty}^{+\infty} {\mathrm{e}}^{-x^2} H_m(x) H_n(x)\,{\mathrm{d}}x = 2^n n! \sqrt{\pi}\,\delta_{m,n}
Recursie H_{n+1}(x) + 2n H_{n-1}(x) = 2x H_n(x), Rodrigues H_n(x) = (-1)^n {\mathrm{e}}^{x^2}\frac{{\mathrm{d}}^n}{{\mathrm{d}}x^n}{\mathrm{e}}^{-x^2}

Laguerre-veeltermen

I = [0,+\infty), w(x) = \exp(-x): \begin{aligned} &L_0(x) = 1, \quad L_1(x) = 1 - x, \quad L_2(x) = \tfrac{1}{2}(x^2 - 4x + 2),\\ &L_3(x) = \tfrac{1}{6}(-x^3 + 9x^2 - 18x + 6), \quad \ldots\end{aligned}
Genererende functie: \frac{1}{1 - t}\exp\left(-x\frac{t}{1 - t}\right) = \sum_{n=0}^{+\infty} L_n(x)\, t^n \rightarrow {\left\langle L_m,L_n\right\rangle}_w = \delta_{m,n} (orthonormaal)
Recursie (n+1) L_{n+1}(x) + n L_{n-1}(x) = (2n + 1 - x) L_n(x)
Waterstofatoom: veralgemeende Laguerre-veeltermen L_n^{(\alpha)}, orthogonaal met w(x) = x^\alpha {\mathrm{e}}^{-x}

