Propositie 8.16.

Lineariteit: h(x) = a f(x) + b g(x) \implies \hat{h}_k = a\hat{f}_k + b\hat{g}_k
Translatie: h(x) = f(x - x_0) \implies \hat{h}_k = {\mathrm{e}}^{-{\mathrm{i}}\frac{2\pi}{L} k x_0}\hat{f}_k
Modulatie: h(x) = f(x)\,{\mathrm{e}}^{{\mathrm{i}}\frac{2\pi}{L} k_0 x} \implies \hat{h}_k = \hat{f}_{k - k_0}
Conjugatie: h(x) = \overline{f(x)} \implies \hat{h}_k = \overline{\hat{f}_{-k}}
Tijd-/frequentie-omkering: h(x) = f(-x) \implies \hat{h}_k = \hat{f}_{-k}
Discrete herschaling: h(x) = f(sx) \implies \hat{h}_k = \begin{cases}\hat{f}_{k/s}, & k \text{ veelvoud van } s\\ 0, & \text{anders}\end{cases}, \quad s \in {\mathbb{N}}_0

